{
  "scene_id": "act4_scene2_confrontation",
  "start": "n1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/club2/evening1.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 1.0,
      "next": "n2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_music",
      "track": "assets/music/editors_life.ogg",
      "volume": 0.5,
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 1.5,
      "next": "n3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The evening light cuts across the club room in long, amber streaks. Two weeks since Hanami. The room feels wrong without her -- the empty chair by the keyboard, the absence of her humming. Everyone is here, but it doesn't feel like everyone.",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiffany stands by the window, arms crossed, staring at the floor. She looks like she hasn't slept.",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "angry",
      "transition": "slide_right",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her chair is still there. Someone put her music folder on the shelf instead of throwing it away.",
      "next": "n8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "anxious",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "angry",
      "text": "So. Are you going to tell us, or do we have to pretend we don't already know?",
      "next": "n10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "...",
      "next": "n11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "angry",
      "text": "How long have you known, Tiffany? How long have you been lying to us?",
      "next": "n12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "Since before the festival. I thought... I thought if we proved ourselves—",
      "next": "n13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "angry",
      "text": "You THOUGHT? You put everyone through hell based on a thought?",
      "next": "n14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "So it was all for nothing? Everything we worked for... the late nights, the stress, all of it?",
      "next": "n15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The silence stretches. Nobody wants to be the one to say what everyone is thinking.",
      "next": "n16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "Hanami would say... she would say the music was real. That nothing can take that away.",
      "next": "n17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n17",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "angry",
      "text": "...Yeah. She would.",
      "next": "n18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n18",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A heavy silence settles over the room. Tiffany's composure is crumbling.",
      "next": "n19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n19",
      "type": "if",
      "condition": "tiffany_rot <= 2",
      "trueNode": "n20_high_rot",
      "falseNode": "n20_low_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n20_high_rot",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "shake_screen",
      "intensity": 3,
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n21_high_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n21_high_rot",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "broken_blood",
      "text": "I FAILED everyone! Is that what you want to hear?! I failed and I KNEW I was failing and I couldn't STOP!",
      "text_effect": "shake",
      "effect_intensity": 3.0,
      "next": "n22_high_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n22_high_rot",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "glitch",
      "intensity": 2.0,
      "duration": 0.6,
      "next": "n23_high_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n23_high_rot",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She's screaming now, tears streaming down her face. Her hands are shaking uncontrollably.",
      "next": "n26_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n20_low_rot",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "I'm sorry. I'm so sorry. I thought I was protecting everyone, but I was just... scared.",
      "next": "n21_low_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n21_low_rot",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She's hurt, and she's barely holding it together. But she's still standing.",
      "next": "n26_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n26_converge",
      "type": "if",
      "condition": "cassian_trust >= 4",
      "trueNode": "n27_cassian_rally",
      "falseNode": "n27_cassian_storms"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27_cassian_rally",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "...Look. I'm angry. I have every right to be angry.",
      "next": "n28_cassian_rally"
    },
    {
      "id": "n28_cassian_rally",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "But we're not giving up. Not like this. If this club is going down, it goes down on our terms.",
      "next": "n30_converge2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27_cassian_storms",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "angry",
      "text": "I can't be in this room right now. I can't even look at you.",
      "next": "n28_cassian_storms"
    },
    {
      "id": "n28_cassian_storms",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/door_slam.wav",
      "volume": 0.7,
      "next": "n29_cassian_storms"
    },
    {
      "id": "n29_cassian_storms",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n29b_narration"
    },
    {
      "id": "n29b_narration",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The door slams behind him. The silence that follows is deafening.",
      "next": "n30_converge2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n30_converge2",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Everyone looks at me. Somehow, the next move is mine.",
      "next": "n31"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "We fight to save the club.",
          "target": "n32_fight"
        },
        {
          "text": "Maybe it's time to let go.",
          "target": "n32_letgo"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's make our last performance count.",
          "target": "n32_last"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n32_fight",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "No. We're not done. If the school wants to shut us down, we make them reconsider. We fight for this.",
      "next": "n33_fight_trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33_fight_trust",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "tiffany_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n33b_fight_trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33b_fight_trust",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "cassian_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n33c_fight_trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33c_fight_trust",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "cassian_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n33d_fight_trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33d_fight_trust",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "laura_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n34_fight_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n34_fight_react",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "nervous_smile",
      "text": "You really think we can?",
      "next": "n35_fight_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n35_fight_react",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "I think we have to try.",
      "next": "n40_converge3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n32_letgo",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Maybe... maybe it's time to let go. Some things aren't meant to last forever.",
      "next": "n33_letgo_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33_letgo_rot",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "tiffany_rot",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "subtract",
      "next": "n33b_letgo_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33b_letgo_rot",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "cassian_rot",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "subtract",
      "next": "n33c_letgo_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33c_letgo_rot",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "tiffany_rot",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "subtract",
      "next": "n33d_letgo_rot"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33d_letgo_rot",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "laura_rot",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n34_letgo_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n34_letgo_react",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The room goes very quiet. Laura's crying gets worse.",
      "next": "n35_letgo_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n35_letgo_react",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You think of what Hanami said, before everything. \"I'd like to play together one more time. If that's okay.\" You realize you never got the chance.",
      "next": "n40_converge3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n32_last",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "If this is really the end, then let's make it mean something. One last performance. Not for the school. For us.",
      "next": "n33_last_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33_last_react",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You think of Hanami, and how much she would have wanted this.",
      "next": "n34_last_react"
    },
    {
      "id": "n34_last_react",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "tearful_smile",
      "text": "Yeah... me too.",
      "next": "n40_converge3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n40_converge3",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There's a fragile agreement in the air. Not hope exactly, but something close. A refusal to end in silence.",
      "next": "n41"
    },
    {
      "id": "n41",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Then... let's play. Right now. Before we lose our nerve.",
      "next": "n42"
    },
    {
      "id": "n42",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/guitar_tuning.wav",
      "volume": 0.5,
      "next": "n43"
    },
    {
      "id": "n43",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instruments come out. Fingers find familiar positions. For a moment, it's like nothing has changed.",
      "next": "n44"
    },
    {
      "id": "n44",
      "type": "game",
      "song": "unity_or_ruin_generated",
      "next": "n45"
    },
    {
      "id": "n45",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The last note fades. Nobody moves.",
      "next": "n46"
    },
    {
      "id": "n46",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For one perfect moment, the music held all the broken pieces together. Maybe that's all any of us can ask for.",
      "next": "n47"
    },
    {
      "id": "n47",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_flag",
      "flag": "flags.act3_complete",
      "value": true,
      "next": "n48"
    },
